.* QUILIND: WRKLIND and DSPLIND, the line descriptions (net/cmncfg).
.* DSPLIND's values carry their keyword in front ("RSRCNAME    CMN04")
.* until F11 takes it away.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=HINTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 19'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=POSTO CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=POSHINT CLASS=HINTCL VALUE='Starting characters'.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=LIND CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LINTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LINTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=LINRSC CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LINSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=DLIND CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DOPTION CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DCAT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DRSRC CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DAGGPCY CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DAGGRSCL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DBRIDGE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DONLINE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DVRYWAIT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DNETCTL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DADPTADR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DEXCHID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DETHSTD CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DSPEED CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DCURSPD CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DDUPLEX CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DCURDPX CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DSRVOPT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMAXFRM CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMAXCTL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTHRESH CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DGENTST CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMSGQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DCURMSGQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DCURMSGL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTEXT CLASS=VALCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=LINES VARS='OPT LIND LINTYPE LINTEXT LINRSC LINSTS'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Create
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display details
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F14 ACTION='RETURN 14'.F14=Work with status
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Nondisplay keywords
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKLIND KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKLINDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Line Descriptions
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=22.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=POSTO USAGE=INPUT.Position to
:DATAIX VAR=POSHINT USAGE=OUTPUT.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LINES VIEWS=2 MAXHEAD=2 SCROLL=YES.(No line descriptions)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGLINETH LIND(&LIND.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD ?CRTLINETH'.3=Copy
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTLIND LIND(&LIND.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPLIND LIND(&LIND.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD DSPLIND LIND(&LIND.) OUTPUT(*PRINT)'.6=Print
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='CMD ?RNMOBJ OBJ(QSYS/&LIND.) OBJTYPE(*LIND)'.7=Rename
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKCFGSTS CFGTYPE(*LIN) CFGD(&LIND.)'.8=Work with status
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 109'.9=Retrieve source
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LIND USAGE=OUTPUT.Line
:LISTCOL VAR=LINTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=LINTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTCOL VAR=LINRSC USAGE=OUTPUT.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=LINSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT LIND LINTYPE LINTEXT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT LIND LINTYPE LINRSC LINSTS'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPLIND KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPLINDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=DATETIME.Display Line Description
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=36.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=DLIND USAGE=OUTPUT.Line description
:DATAI VAR=DOPTION USAGE=OUTPUT.Option
:DATAI VAR=DCAT USAGE=OUTPUT.Category of line
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=36.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=DRSRC USAGE=OUTPUT.Resource name
:DATAI VAR=DBRIDGE USAGE=OUTPUT.Bridge identifier
:DATAI VAR=DONLINE USAGE=OUTPUT.Online at IPL
:DATAI VAR=DVRYWAIT USAGE=OUTPUT.Vary on wait
:DATAI VAR=DNETCTL USAGE=OUTPUT.Network controller
:DATAI VAR=DADPTADR USAGE=OUTPUT.Local adapter address
:DATAI VAR=DEXCHID USAGE=OUTPUT.Exchange identifier
:DATAI VAR=DETHSTD USAGE=OUTPUT.Ethernet standard
:DATAI VAR=DSPEED USAGE=OUTPUT.Line speed
:DATAI VAR=DCURSPD USAGE=OUTPUT.Current line speed
:DATAI VAR=DDUPLEX USAGE=OUTPUT.Duplex
:DATAI VAR=DCURDPX USAGE=OUTPUT.Current duplex
:DATAI VAR=DSRVOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Serviceability options
:DATAI VAR=DMAXFRM USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum frame size
:DATAI VAR=DMAXCTL USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum controllers
:DATAI VAR=DTHRESH USAGE=OUTPUT.Error threshold level
:DATAI VAR=DGENTST USAGE=OUTPUT.Generate test frame
:DATAI VAR=DMSGQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Message queue
:DATAI VAR=DCURMSGQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Current message queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=DCURMSGL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=DTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* DSPLIND of an aggregated line: its policy and ports after the resource.
:PANEL NAME=DSPLINDA KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPLINDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=DATETIME.Display Line Description
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=36.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=DLIND USAGE=OUTPUT.Line description
:DATAI VAR=DOPTION USAGE=OUTPUT.Option
:DATAI VAR=DCAT USAGE=OUTPUT.Category of line
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=36.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=DRSRC USAGE=OUTPUT.Resource name
:DATAI VAR=DAGGPCY USAGE=OUTPUT.Aggregate policy
:DATAI VAR=DAGGRSCL USAGE=OUTPUT.Aggregated resource list
:DATAI VAR=DBRIDGE USAGE=OUTPUT.Bridge identifier
:DATAI VAR=DONLINE USAGE=OUTPUT.Online at IPL
:DATAI VAR=DVRYWAIT USAGE=OUTPUT.Vary on wait
:DATAI VAR=DNETCTL USAGE=OUTPUT.Network controller
:DATAI VAR=DADPTADR USAGE=OUTPUT.Local adapter address
:DATAI VAR=DEXCHID USAGE=OUTPUT.Exchange identifier
:DATAI VAR=DETHSTD USAGE=OUTPUT.Ethernet standard
:DATAI VAR=DSPEED USAGE=OUTPUT.Line speed
:DATAI VAR=DCURSPD USAGE=OUTPUT.Current line speed
:DATAI VAR=DDUPLEX USAGE=OUTPUT.Duplex
:DATAI VAR=DCURDPX USAGE=OUTPUT.Current duplex
:DATAI VAR=DSRVOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Serviceability options
:DATAI VAR=DMAXFRM USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum frame size
:DATAI VAR=DMAXCTL USAGE=OUTPUT.Maximum controllers
:DATAI VAR=DTHRESH USAGE=OUTPUT.Error threshold level
:DATAI VAR=DGENTST USAGE=OUTPUT.Generate test frame
:DATAI VAR=DMSGQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Message queue
:DATAI VAR=DCURMSGQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Current message queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=DCURMSGL USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=DTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKLINDH.Work with Line Descriptions - Help
:P.The line descriptions in name order, with their type and text; F11
shows each line's resource and status instead. Type an option next to
a line to change, copy, delete, display, print or rename it, or to see
its status, and press Enter. Type a name in Position to and press
Enter to start the list there.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPLINDH.Display Line Description - Help
:P.What a line description says, each value after the keyword that
sets it; F11 shows the values alone. The current speed and duplex are
the port's own when the line is varied on. CHGLINETH changes the line.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F5 shows the list again, F6 creates an Ethernet line, F14 shows the
status of every line, F9 brings back the last command, F3 and F12
leave.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
